        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Hpiv (0.102 g, 1.0 mmol) and CrCl3·6H2O (0.2 mmol, 0.053 g) were dissolved in CH3CN (15 mL) with Et3N (0.6 mL). After stirring 1 h at room temperature, CH2Cl2 (15 mL) was added and the mixture was stirred another 1 h. Gd(NO3)3·6H2O (0.3 mmol, 0.135 g) was added and the mixture was stirred 0.5 h with heating, giving a light-purple solution that was filtered. Purple crystals suitable for SCXRD formed after about two weeks.",
